      "body": "And, while in AMP Stories also I'm using only one div in consent, but create my custom array: \"mylist\" in amp-geo and in consent is mentioned \"promptIfUnknownForGeoGroup\": \"mylist\".\r\nAMP-Geo:\r\n<script type=\"application/json\">\r\n            {\r\n            \"ISOCountryGroups\": {\r\n            \"eea\": [\"preset-eea\"],\r\n\r\n             \"usca\":[\"preset-us-ca\"],\r\n\r\n\t     \"mylist\":[\"preset-eea\",\"preset-us-ca\",\"in\"]\r\n            }\r\n            }\r\n        </script>\r\n AMP-Consent:\r\n            <script type=\"application/json\">\r\n               {\r\n               \"consents\": {\r\n               \"storyConsent\": {\r\n               \"promptIfUnknownForGeoGroup\": \"mylist\",\r\n               \"promptUI\": \"storyConsentUi\"\r\n               }\r\n               }\r\n               }\r\n            </script>\r\n\r\n",
